[
  {
    "id": "ld-107-1-2-8-fill-1-1",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "計算並化簡：$\\sqrt3\\times\\sqrt5=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "df23edec6612f5d48c5ded15f1bea8a6d915625a1e926a0d87d1081b1857a62b"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-107-1-2-8-fill-1-2",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "計算並化簡：$\\sqrt{84}=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "df23edec6612f5d48c5ded15f1bea8a6d915625a1e926a0d87d1081b1857a62b"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-107-1-2-8-fill-1-3",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "計算並化簡：$\\sqrt2+\\sqrt4+\\sqrt6+\\sqrt8=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "df23edec6612f5d48c5ded15f1bea8a6d915625a1e926a0d87d1081b1857a62b"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-107-1-2-8-fill-1-4",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "計算並化簡：$\\sqrt{\\frac57}=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "df23edec6612f5d48c5ded15f1bea8a6d915625a1e926a0d87d1081b1857a62b"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-107-1-2-8-fill-1-5",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "計算並化簡：$\\sqrt{1\\frac57}\\times\\sqrt{1\\frac56}\\div\\sqrt{\\frac{11}{28}}=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "df23edec6612f5d48c5ded15f1bea8a6d915625a1e926a0d87d1081b1857a62b"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-107-1-2-8-fill-1-6",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$(\\sqrt6+\\sqrt5)$ 的倒數為＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "df23edec6612f5d48c5ded15f1bea8a6d915625a1e926a0d87d1081b1857a62b"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-107-1-2-8-fill-2",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "下列哪些為 $\\sqrt3$ 的同類方根？解：＿＿＿＿。\n$2\\sqrt3$、$\\sqrt6$、$\\sqrt9$、$\\sqrt{12}$、$\\sqrt{15}$、$\\sqrt{30}$、$\\sqrt{\\frac13}$。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "df23edec6612f5d48c5ded15f1bea8a6d915625a1e926a0d87d1081b1857a62b"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-107-1-2-8-fill-3-1",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "因式分解：$3x^2+x=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "df23edec6612f5d48c5ded15f1bea8a6d915625a1e926a0d87d1081b1857a62b"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-107-1-2-8-fill-3-2",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "因式分解：$(2x+5)(x+3y)-(x-1)(x+3y)=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "df23edec6612f5d48c5ded15f1bea8a6d915625a1e926a0d87d1081b1857a62b"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-107-1-2-8-fill-3-3",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "因式分解：$(x+2y)(a-b)+(2x-y)(b-a)=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "df23edec6612f5d48c5ded15f1bea8a6d915625a1e926a0d87d1081b1857a62b"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-107-1-2-8-fill-3-4",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "因式分解：$x^2-4y^2-12y-9=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "df23edec6612f5d48c5ded15f1bea8a6d915625a1e926a0d87d1081b1857a62b"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-107-1-2-8-fill-4",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$x+1$ 為 $x^3+1$ 的因式，則 $x^3+1$ 可因式分解為＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "df23edec6612f5d48c5ded15f1bea8a6d915625a1e926a0d87d1081b1857a62b"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-107-1-2-8-fill-5",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若直角三角形的三邊長中，有兩邊為5、10，則第三邊為＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "df23edec6612f5d48c5ded15f1bea8a6d915625a1e926a0d87d1081b1857a62b"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-107-1-2-8-fill-6",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "已知一長方形面積為48平方公分，長是8公分，則其對角線長為＿＿＿＿公分。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "df23edec6612f5d48c5ded15f1bea8a6d915625a1e926a0d87d1081b1857a62b"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-107-1-2-8-fill-7",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "已知坐標平面上 $A(1,7)$、$B(-2,-1)$，則 $\\overline{AB}=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "df23edec6612f5d48c5ded15f1bea8a6d915625a1e926a0d87d1081b1857a62b"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-107-1-2-8-fill-8",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "如圖，直角 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，$\\overline{AD}\\perp\\overline{BC}$，$\\overline{DE}\\perp\\overline{AB}$，$\\overline{AB}=24$、$\\overline{BC}=30$，則 $\\overline{DE}=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "df23edec6612f5d48c5ded15f1bea8a6d915625a1e926a0d87d1081b1857a62b",
