    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "如圖，$\\angle ACB=90^\\circ$，$\\overline{AB}=13$、$\\overline{AC}=5$、$\\overline{AD}=\\sqrt{30}$，則 $\\overline{BD}=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
