  },
  {
    "id": "ld-107-1-2-8-fill-12",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "如圖，$ABCD$ 為長方形，$\\overline{AD}=12$、$\\overline{AB}=8$。將 $D$ 點摺至 $B$ 點，$\\overline{PQ}$ 為摺痕，則 $\\triangle BPQ$ 的面積為＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "df23edec6612f5d48c5ded15f1bea8a6d915625a1e926a0d87d1081b1857a62b",
